{
  "version": 21,
  "variables": [],
  "tiles": {
    "0": {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "### Argo CD Applications and Versions\n\nCurrent version of every Argo CD application. **Version** is the container image tag from the Argo CD SDLC events (subscribed apps only); **Health** and **Sync** come from Argo CD metrics and cover all apps. Apps marked *Suspended* are usually blue-green rollouts waiting for promotion."
    },
    "1": {
      "davis": {
        "davisVisualization": {
          "isAvailable": true
        },
        "enabled": false
      },
      "query": "timeseries v = avg(argocd_app_info), by: {name, health_status, sync_status, project, dest_namespace}\n| fieldsRemove v\n| summarize Apps = countDistinct(name)",
      "querySettings": {
        "defaultSamplingRatio": 10,
        "defaultScanLimitGbytes": 500,
        "enableSampling": false,
        "maxResultMegaBytes": 1,
        "maxResultRecords": 1000
      },
      "title": "Applications managed",
      "type": "data",
      "visualization": "singleValue",
      "visualizationSettings": {
        "autoSelectVisualization": false,
        "coloring": {
          "thresholdRules": []
        },
        "singleValue": {
          "label": "Apps",
          "labelMode": "none",
          "recordField": "Apps",
          "trend": {
            "isVisible": false
          }
        }
      },
      "timeframe": {
        "tileTimeframe": {
          "from": "now()-5m",
          "to": "now()"
        },
        "tileTimeframeEnabled": true
      }
    },
    "2": {
      "davis": {
        "davisVisualization": {
          "isAvailable": true
        },
        "enabled": false
      },
      "query": "fetch events\n| filter event.kind == \"SDLC_EVENT\" and event.provider == \"argocd\" and event.status == \"finished\"\n| filter isNotNull(argocd.app.version)\n| summarize Apps = countDistinct(cicd.deployment.name)",
      "querySettings": {
        "defaultSamplingRatio": 10,
        "defaultScanLimitGbytes": 500,
        "enableSampling": false,
        "maxResultMegaBytes": 1,
        "maxResultRecords": 1000
      },
      "title": "Apps with a known version",
      "type": "data",
      "visualization": "singleValue",
      "visualizationSettings": {
        "autoSelectVisualization": false,
        "coloring": {
          "thresholdRules": []
        },
        "singleValue": {
          "label": "Apps",
          "labelMode": "none",
          "recordField": "Apps",
          "trend": {
            "isVisible": false
          }
        }
      },
      "timeframe": {
        "tileTimeframe": {
          "from": "now()-30d",
          "to": "now()"
        },
        "tileTimeframeEnabled": true
      }
    },
    "3": {
      "davis": {
        "davisVisualization": {
          "isAvailable": true
        },
        "enabled": false
